### Send get application
GET http://localhost:3000/api/applications

### Create an application
POST http://localhost:3000/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "1",
    "companyName": "Ggsdf",
    "jobTitle": "Software Engineer Intern",
    "category": "SWE",
    "dateApplied": "2026-10-20",
    "status": "Applied",
    "jobUrl": "https://example.com/job1"
}

### Update an application with its id
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/applications/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "2",
    "companyName": "ABCd",
    "jobTitle": "Software Engineer Intern",
    "category": "SWE",
    "dateApplied": "2026-10-20",
    "status": "Applied",
    "jobUrl": "https://example.com/job1"
}

### Delete and applications with its id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/applications/2
